02: |  Inline formula: The attention weight is $\alpha_{i,j} =                       |
03: |  \frac{\exp(e_{i,j})}{\sum_{k=1}^n \exp(e_{i,k})}$.                            |
04: |                                                                                |
05: |  Display formula:                                                              |
06: |                                                                                |
07: |  $$\sigma(z)j = \frac{e^{z_j}}{\sum{k=1}^K e^{z_k}} \quad \text{for } j        |
08: |  = 1, \dots, K$$                                                               |
09: |                                                                                |
10: |  And polynomial evaluation:                                                    |
11: |                                                                                |
12: |  $$f(x) = \sum_{i=0}^n a_i x^i$$                                               |
